phi-transport-ws (0.1.6~git202609071848.a9e54d9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The origin gate accepts a browser whose Origin names the same host the
    request asked for, so the packaged UI works from any device on the network
    under any of the box's names without listing each one in allowedOrigins.
    A foreign page still cannot match and is still refused.
  * Loopback is parsed as four octets rather than matched as a "127." prefix:
    127.example.com is a registrable name, not this machine.

